                            FONT NOTICE

This directory previously embedded DejaVu Sans Condensed (Bitstream
Vera + DejaVu license, freely redistributable). It now embeds Microsoft
Tahoma in order to match the canonical CS 1.6 PC menu look exactly.

Tahoma is the property of Microsoft Corporation:

    Typeface and data (c) 1995-1999 Microsoft Corporation.
    All Rights Reserved.
    Vendor: http://www.microsoft.com/typography

Microsoft does not license Tahoma for free public redistribution. The
font is included in every retail copy of Microsoft Windows and several
Microsoft Office products.

WHEN THIS BUILD IS LEGAL TO PRODUCE
- The repository hosting this file is private and will not be made
  public.
- The end user owns at least one valid Microsoft licence (Windows or
  Office) that grants them the right to use Tahoma on their devices.
- The resulting binary is used only on devices belonging to the end
  user.

WHEN IT IS NOT
- Pushing this file or a binary containing it to a public repository.
- Redistributing the resulting APK to any third party who does not
  already hold a Microsoft licence covering Tahoma.

THIS NOTICE IS NOT A LICENCE
This notice does not grant any rights you do not already hold under
your Microsoft End User Licence Agreement. The maintainers of this
project make no warranty regarding the legality of any specific use.
You are responsible for verifying that your use is permitted by the
licences you hold.

REVERTING TO A FREE FONT
If you ever need to make this build redistributable, replace
`source.ttf` with a freely-licensed font (e.g. DejaVu Sans Condensed -
Bitstream Vera + DejaVu, or Noto Sans Regular - SIL Open Font Licence
1.1) and rerun `gen_embedded.py`. Both fall back cleanly to the same
logical "Tahoma" slot.
